<title>GERMANY: Japan's Mitsuzuka says agrees with Germany on forex.</title>
<headline>Japan's Mitsuzuka says agrees with Germany on forex.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka made clear on Saturday that he was in agreement with Germany on the state of currency relations.</p>
<p>Asked by reporters whether Japan and Germany had agreed on the issue of currencies, he said: &quot;Yes, that is right.&quot;</p>
<p>He declined to elaborate.</p>
</text>
